{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T09:41:58.059Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f80f11f5e7298385ac19a0ee","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T09:41:58.059Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-02T09:41:58.054Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Duplicate GH278 provenance reconciled. Both owners were identified from the failing run 41407648593 ('import plan is not idempotent — 1 duplicate provenance tag(s)') and a tracker scan: the cited-evidence inspection feature (kept as sole owner — PR 278 delivers it and its record declares that tag for exact sync identity) and the SDK evidence-fragments record (de-owned). The de-owned record's gh: tag was removed with 'pm update --remove-tags', a related dependency now links it to the owning feature record, its delivery knowledge (body, comments, files, tests, close evidence) is untouched and its status stays closed. Measurement — before: failing run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/actions/runs/41407648593 (2026-11-02T07:38Z, 'Preview GitHub to pm plan' step). After: the same gated dry-run the scheduled workflow runs (pm-github 2026.10.19 as pinned by the reusable workflow) passes against this branch's tracker: fetched 10, planned 10, import 6, update 4, skip 0, provenance-indexed 11, gate verified with no duplicate provenance tag. The command is linked as a passing test; its pm-test receipt runs in pm's isolated seeded workspace, so the reconciliation numbers here come from the direct dry-run against this checkout. GitHub API budget was checked before measuring (core remaining above the 1500 floor). Guard unchanged; item stays open for orchestrator close after merge."}]}],"before_hash":"f3c60b598b3dbd555b5297a4c292faf69e57bc93b5ea6b9597e81927a22ea119","after_hash":"5399829509e1602b812e9b5f5cce0c55044fa81047c22b6658c80a62d28d252c","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"86da289e5969d5b206619e5e1a35ee59b4a3868ec95ddd64d2018a62b7dcec0a"}
